{"src":"en","tgt":"tr","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":165000,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"tr","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":7942.308021,"text":"The Shenzhen zone however works somewhat like one country in this respect."},{"kind":"text","t":8604.492997000001,"text":"Ancak Shenzhen bölgesi bu açıdan bir ülke gibi işliyor."},{"kind":"audio","t":8709.617567000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8713.103669,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8715.524148,"samples":21678,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":760},{"kind":"input","t":15103.406426000001,"text":"Resting on the top of one of the mountains north of Mecca, the cave is closely"},{"kind":"text","t":16230.238046999999,"text":"Mekke'nin kuzeyindeki dağlardan birinin zirvesinde yer alan mağara, oldukça yakın bir mesafededir."},{"kind":"audio","t":16354.534416999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16359.286778000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16364.554701000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16369.828533,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16370.358954,"samples":7968,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":160},{"kind":"input","t":17736.811606,"text":"isolated from the rest of the world."},{"kind":"text","t":18290.067376,"text":"Dünyanın geri kalanından izole durumda."},{"kind":"audio","t":18352.471037,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18356.352162,"samples":26582,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":990},{"kind":"input","t":26273.688948,"text":"People now write messages on computer screens never having to come close to a sharpener."},{"kind":"text","t":27395.165158,"text":"İnsanlar artık bileyiciye yaklaşmak zorunda kalmadan bilgisayar ekranları üzerine mesajlar yazıyorlar."},{"kind":"audio","t":27529.822386,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27534.949411,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27540.248973,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27545.563924000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27548.781851,"samples":21900,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":770},{"kind":"input","t":37524.007038,"text":"Travelers bound for countries with heavy taxation can sometimes save a considerable amount of money, especially on products such as alcoholic beverages and tobacco."},{"kind":"text","t":39280.89081,"text":"Yüksek vergilendirme uygulanan ülkelere seyahat edenler, özellikle alkollü içecekler ve tütün gibi ürünlerde önemli miktarda para tasarrufu yapabilirler."},{"kind":"audio","t":39466.574949,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39471.90481,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39476.790889,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39482.12586,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39487.339153,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39492.712484,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39497.294247,"samples":29368,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1080},{"kind":"input","t":45773.319387,"text":"Plants make their food from the sun by photosynthesis. They also provide shade."},{"kind":"text","t":46553.781914,"text":"Bitkiler, fotosentez yoluyla güneşten besin üretirler. Aynı zamanda gölge de sağlarlar."},{"kind":"audio","t":46652.400922,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46657.412669,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46661.088168,"samples":23628,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":890},{"kind":"audio","t":46666.807333,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46670.067468,"samples":22402,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":810},{"kind":"input","t":58052.162734,"text":"The hospital has followed protocol for infection control, including separating the patient from others to prevent possible infection of others."},{"kind":"text","t":59666.150786,"text":"Hastane, başkalarının olası enfeksiyonunu önlemek için hastayı diğerlerinden ayırma da dahil olmak üzere enfeksiyon kontrolü protokollerine uymuştur."},{"kind":"audio","t":59839.246674,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59844.404698,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59849.615961,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59854.941103,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59860.129366,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59865.436518,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59868.865491000004,"samples":23238,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":830},{"kind":"input","t":68162.82280699999,"text":"The work done was mostly theoretical, but the program was written to simulate observations made of the Sagittarius galaxy."},{"kind":"text","t":69897.780254,"text":"Yapılan çalışmalar çoğunlukla teorik nitelikteydi; ancak program, Okçular takımyıldızındaki gözlemleri simüle etmek üzere yazılmıştı."},{"kind":"audio","t":69990.55127,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69995.576286,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69996.118687,"samples":8303,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":160},{"kind":"audio","t":70030.53715399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":70033.61953299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":70036.91115799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":70039.578803,"samples":27083,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":920},{"kind":"input","t":78290.797951,"text":"Barcelona's official languages are Catalan and Spanish. About half prefer to speak Catalan, a vast majority understands it, and virtually everyone knows Spanish."},{"kind":"text","t":80033.56848799999,"text":"Barselona'nın resmi dilleri Katalanca ve İspanyolca'dır. Yaklaşık yarısı Katalanca konuşmayı tercih eder, büyük bir çoğunluk bunu anlar ve neredeyse herkes İspanyolca bilmektedir."},{"kind":"audio","t":80125.580726,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":80126.948353,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":80127.808719,"samples":23628,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":850},{"kind":"audio","t":80195.11672899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":80196.301159,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":80197.507109,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":80199.2276,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":80200.89277199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":80201.61611999999,"samples":21176,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":720},{"kind":"input","t":83788.579426,"text":"In some areas, boiling water for a minute is enough and other several minutes are needed."},{"kind":"text","t":84948.2806,"text":"Bazı bölgelerde suyun bir dakika kaynatılması yeterliyken, diğerlerinde birkaç dakika daha gereklidir."},{"kind":"audio","t":85078.386174,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85083.35495099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85088.62806399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85094.04959299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85096.13096899999,"samples":16606,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":460},{"kind":"input","t":89845.82647799999,"text":"Plants look their best when in a natural environment, so resist the temptation to remove even just one stem."},{"kind":"text","t":91319.55250399999,"text":"Bitkiler doğal ortamlarında en iyi görünümlerine kavuşurlar; bu yüzden tek bir gövdeyi bile çıkarma isteğine karşı koyun."},{"kind":"audio","t":91439.69473399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91444.72227,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91448.472438,"samples":25021,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":960},{"kind":"audio","t":91453.77468999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91459.328407,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91462.350467,"samples":22513,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":820},{"kind":"input","t":97259.46834899999,"text":"During the 1920s, the prevailing attitudes of most citizens and nations was that of pacifism and isolation."},{"kind":"text","t":98387.265044,"text":"1920’lerde, çoğu vatandaşın ve ulusun hâkim tutumu pasifizm ve izolasyondu."},{"kind":"audio","t":98506.603267,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98511.70570199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98516.955055,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98522.33286499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98523.094153,"samples":9083,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":280},{"kind":"input","t":103516.983517,"text":"Masa Serif was the apex predator of its time, so it feared nothing except other Mosul"},{"kind":"text","t":105011.44357799999,"text":"Masa Serif, kendi döneminin en güçlü yırtıcısıydı; bu yüzden diğer Mosul’ler dışında hiçbir şeyden korkmazdı."},{"kind":"audio","t":105102.38244399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":105107.58002699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":105109.68489199999,"samples":16105,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":600},{"kind":"audio","t":105123.854786,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":105129.05629,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":105132.757728,"samples":25021,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":770},{"kind":"input","t":113121.10482099999,"text":"Since the foundation of Asuncion in 1537, Paraguay has managed to keep a lot of its indigenous character and identity."},{"kind":"text","t":114564.764738,"text":"1537’de Asunción’un kurulmasından bu yana Paraguay, yerli karakterini ve kimliğinin büyük bir bölümünü korumayı başarmıştır."},{"kind":"audio","t":114731.75335799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114736.926922,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114742.18531399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114747.509545,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114752.63042999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114757.955311,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":114758.40062399999,"samples":3455,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":119858.641028,"text":"The disease is carried by pigs, which then migrates to humans through mosquitoes."},{"kind":"text","t":120928.861591,"text":"Hastalık domuzlar tarafından taşınır ve daha sonra sivrisinekler aracılığıyla insana bulaşır."},{"kind":"audio","t":121046.68897999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":121051.769275,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":121057.216754,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":121062.395848,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":121062.703553,"samples":2953,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":129344.54765099999,"text":"Most modern research telescopes are enormous facilities in remote areas with favorable atmospheric conditions."},{"kind":"text","t":130872.28943699998,"text":"Günümüzdeki çoğu modern araştırma teleskobu, elverişli atmosfer koşullarına sahip uzak bölgelerde bulunan devasa tesislerdir."},{"kind":"audio","t":131035.54761999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":470,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131040.739453,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131046.033855,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131051.450735,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131056.63864800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131062.21938499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131062.72656699999,"samples":6798,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":80},{"kind":"input","t":135212.903087,"text":"People may not anticipate that patience and understanding are also necessary for travelers"},{"kind":"text","t":136275.92057000002,"text":"İnsanlar, seyahat edenler için sabır ve anlayışın da gerekli olduğunu tahmin edemeyebilir."},{"kind":"audio","t":136394.216961,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136399.288096,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136404.668027,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136409.784372,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136410.077337,"samples":4068,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":50},{"kind":"input","t":140529.362881,"text":"So it is likely that the notation was added simply as a label."},{"kind":"text","t":141404.423943,"text":"Bu yüzden bu işaretlemenin sadece bir etiket olarak eklenmiş olması muhtemeldir."},{"kind":"audio","t":141516.705254,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141521.876858,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141527.08511100002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141531.95382,"samples":31263,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1120},{"kind":"input","t":147759.797312,"text":"But there are a lot of things about birds that still look like a dinosaur."},{"kind":"text","t":148684.662325,"text":"Ancak kuşlarla ilgili hâlâ dinozorlara benzeyen birçok şey vardır."},{"kind":"audio","t":148785.046364,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148790.14741900002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148795.385442,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148795.86477400002,"samples":7578,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":160},{"kind":"input","t":154945.258032,"text":"They are almost all sandy beaches with safe swimming and most have shade provided by"},{"kind":"text","t":156185.974247,"text":"Neredeyse hepsi güvenli yüzme koşullarına sahip kumlu plajlardır ve çoğunda gölgelik bulunmaktadır."},{"kind":"audio","t":156308.603955,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156309.982502,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156311.36444900002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156312.878154,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156313.493284,"samples":17721,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":570},{"kind":"input","t":157893.51198,"text":"Pohican trees."},{"kind":"text","t":158229.35586900002,"text":"Pohican ağaçları."},{"kind":"audio","t":158269.94097300002,"samples":32322,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1190},{"kind":"input","t":164333.24391400002,"text":"Duvall, who is married with two adult children, did not leave a big impression on Miller, to whom the story was related."},{"kind":"text","t":165567.962529,"text":"İki yetişkin çocuğu olan evli bir kişi olan Duvall, hikayeyi anlattığı Miller üzerinde pek bir iz bırakmadı."},{"kind":"audio","t":165703.721079,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165708.977772,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165714.12328600002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165719.32134,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165723.427861,"samples":26916,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":930},{"kind":"close","t":175805.683556,"code":1005}]}